{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"dongliu-e-o029","title":"马良留荆州与诸葛亮书","accounts":[{"id":"dongliu-a-a45e2368383c5863d5ad","label":"正文","text":"马良留荆州与诸葛亮书","evidence":["dongliu-q-8fa6cb5059a28fd6b12f","dongliu-q2-61598741f218eb1409e1"]}],"participants":[{"person":"xianzhu-p0121","role":"留荆州，致书诸葛亮贺雒城已拔","evidence":["dongliu-q-8fa6cb5059a28fd6b12f"]},{"person":"zhuge-liang","role":"受马良书者","evidence":["dongliu-q-8fa6cb5059a28fd6b12f"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["dongliu-q-8fa6cb5059a28fd6b12f"]},"ordering_evidence":"dongliu-q-8fa6cb5059a28fd6b12f","source_order":[39,66,25],"order":7169}],"persons":[{"id":"xianzhu-p0121","name":"马良","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"zhuge-liang","name":"诸葛亮","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"dongliu-q-8fa6cb5059a28fd6b12f","section":"chapter-039","block":"b-b78dae76878d5a1fc590","layer":"original","quote":"良留荆州，与亮书曰","section_title":"董刘马陈董吕传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0084.xhtml","index":65,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":25,"end":34,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"dongliu-q2-61598741f218eb1409e1","section":"chapter-039","block":"b-b78dae76878d5a1fc590","layer":"original","quote":"先主领荆州，辟为从事。及先主入蜀，诸葛亮亦从后往；良留荆州，与亮书曰：“闻雒城已拔，此天祚也〖2〗。尊兄应期赞世〖3〗，配业光国〖4〗，魄兆现矣〖5〗。﹝一﹞夫变用雅虑〖6〗，审贵垂明〖7〗，于以简才〖8〗，宜适其时。若乃和光悦远〖9〗，迈德天壤〖10〗；使时闲于（听）〔德〕〖11〗，世服于道；齐高妙之音，正郑、卫之声〖12〗；并利于事，无相夺伦〖13〗：此乃管弦之至〖14〗，牙、旷之调也〖15〗。虽非钟期〖16〗，敢不击节〖17〗！”","section_title":"董刘马陈董吕传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0084.xhtml","index":65,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":220,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
